# Host-gpio solenoid pin (only needed if this rig can reward via a timed
# host pin; skip when juice is a USB pump or an extio *juice* digital out)
juicerSetPin 0 27

# Reward ROUTING and the ml->ms calibration are settings (local/rig.tcl),
# editable from the gear next to the Juice button in ESS Control, or by hand:
#
#   setting juicer destination auto   ;# auto | usb | gpio | extio |
#                                      # extio:<box> | extio:<box>/<pin>
#   setting juicer ms_per_ml 1667     ;# valve-open ms per ml (extio + gpio)
#   setting juicer hand_ml 0.5        ;# Juice-button (bare `reward`) amount
#
# auto prefers: usb pump > first live extio digital out labeled juice* > gpio.
# An explicit destination never falls back: unavailable means reward drops
# with a juicer/error breadcrumb, so a mis-set rig is loud, not quiet.
#
# (Historical note: `set ::juicer_ms_per_ml <n>` in this file still works as
# a runtime override until `setting juicer ms_per_ml` is declared; prefer the
# setting.)
